{"id":"b4d40e46b998c6d5","group":"29","path":"29/29-thm-completeness-capture.md","title":"完全问题导出逻辑刻画","display":"thm-completeness-capture — 完全问题导出逻辑刻画","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Descriptive Complexity (Neil Immerman)","book_abbrev":"29","label":"29-thm-completeness-capture","aliases":["29-thm-completeness-capture"],"display":"thm-completeness-capture — 完全问题导出逻辑刻画","depends_on":["[[29-df-fo-reduction-closure]]","[[29-df-completeness]]","[[29-df-first-order-reduction]]"],"source_locator":"§3.2, capture paradigm following Framework 3.12, p.50, DjVu scan 65","source_basis":"用户提供的 DjVu 隐藏文本层；四步范式已对照，短推导见 Remark"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Descriptive Complexity (Neil Immerman)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"29"},{"key":"label","html":"29-thm-completeness-capture"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>29-thm-completeness-capture</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-completeness-capture — 完全问题导出逻辑刻画"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"5dc6da6f374d15c9\" href=\"?note=5dc6da6f374d15c9\" title=\"29-df-fo-reduction-closure\">29-df-fo-reduction-closure</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5da52cc2e80d709c\" href=\"?note=5da52cc2e80d709c\" title=\"29-df-completeness\">29-df-completeness</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"65b448b4269ca18e\" href=\"?note=65b448b4269ca18e\" title=\"29-df-first-order-reduction\">29-df-first-order-reduction</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_locator","html":"§3.2, capture paradigm following Framework 3.12, p.50, DjVu scan 65"},{"key":"source_basis","html":"用户提供的 DjVu 隐藏文本层；四步范式已对照，短推导见 Remark"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak Q\">\\(\\mathfrak Q\\)</span> 为带输入词汇的布尔查询集合；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C,Q_{\\mathcal L}\\subseteq\\mathfrak Q\">\\(C,Q_{\\mathcal L}\\subseteq\\mathfrak Q\\)</span>，分别表示一个资源类与一种逻辑语言的可定义查询集。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal T\\in\\mathfrak Q\">\\(\\mathcal T\\in\\mathfrak Q\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Complete}\">\\(\\operatorname{Complete}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FOClosed}_{\\mathfrak Q}\">\\(\\operatorname{FOClosed}_{\\mathfrak Q}\\)</span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\leq_{\\mathrm{fo}}\">\\(\\leq_{\\mathrm{fo}}\\)</span> 见所列依赖。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\left(\nQ_{\\mathcal L}\\subseteq C\\ \\land\\\n\\operatorname{Complete}(\\mathcal T,C,\\leq_{\\mathrm{fo}})\\ \\land\\\n\\operatorname{FOClosed}_{\\mathfrak Q}(Q_{\\mathcal L})\\ \\land\\\n\\mathcal T\\in Q_{\\mathcal L}\n\\right)\n\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ Q_{\\mathcal L}=C.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\left(\nQ_{\\mathcal L}\\subseteq C\\ \\land\\\n\\operatorname{Complete}(\\mathcal T,C,\\leq_{\\mathrm{fo}})\\ \\land\\\n\\operatorname{FOClosed}_{\\mathfrak Q}(Q_{\\mathcal L})\\ \\land\\\n\\mathcal T\\in Q_{\\mathcal L}\n\\right)\n\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ Q_{\\mathcal L}=C.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书印刷页50、扫描页65以四步范式给出这一论证。对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal A\\in C\">\\(\\mathcal A\\in C\\)</span>，完全性给出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal A\\leq_{\\mathrm{fo}}\\mathcal T\">\\(\\mathcal A\\leq_{\\mathrm{fo}}\\mathcal T\\)</span>；由 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal T\\in Q_{\\mathcal L}\">\\(\\mathcal T\\in Q_{\\mathcal L}\\)</span> 和闭包得 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal A\\in Q_{\\mathcal L}\">\\(\\mathcal A\\in Q_{\\mathcal L}\\)</span>。于是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\\subseteq Q_{\\mathcal L}\">\\(C\\subseteq Q_{\\mathcal L}\\)</span>，再与第一项合并。这里是集合包含关系的短推导，不把“所有逻辑语言均自动对归约封闭”当作无需验证的前提。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"29-df-fo-reduction-closure","status":"resolved","id":"5dc6da6f374d15c9","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-fo-reduction-closure]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-completeness","status":"resolved","id":"5da52cc2e80d709c","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-completeness]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-first-order-reduction","status":"resolved","id":"65b448b4269ca18e","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-first-order-reduction]]","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathfrak Q","display":false},{"tex":"C,Q_{\\mathcal L}\\subseteq\\mathfrak Q","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal T\\in\\mathfrak Q","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Complete}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{FOClosed}_{\\mathfrak Q}","display":false},{"tex":"\\leq_{\\mathrm{fo}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\left(\nQ_{\\mathcal L}\\subseteq C\\ \\land\\\n\\operatorname{Complete}(\\mathcal T,C,\\leq_{\\mathrm{fo}})\\ \\land\\\n\\operatorname{FOClosed}_{\\mathfrak Q}(Q_{\\mathcal L})\\ \\land\\\n\\mathcal T\\in Q_{\\mathcal L}\n\\right)\n\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ Q_{\\mathcal L}=C.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathcal A\\in C","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal A\\leq_{\\mathrm{fo}}\\mathcal T","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal T\\in Q_{\\mathcal L}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal A\\in Q_{\\mathcal L}","display":false},{"tex":"C\\subseteq Q_{\\mathcal L}","display":false}],"bytes":1633,"backlinks":[{"id":"38909ffa6d1e85ce","anchor":"ref-125","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[29-df-fo-reduction-closure]]、[[29-thm-completeness-capture]] — 归约闭包与完全问题捕获范式"},{"id":"ecc0dd131d213345","anchor":"ref-174","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../29-thm-completeness-capture]]"},{"id":"6de56ec38d538277","anchor":"ref-14","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../29-thm-completeness-capture|29-thm-completeness-capture]]"}],"outgoing":["5dc6da6f374d15c9","5da52cc2e80d709c","65b448b4269ca18e"]}